===== 6) Be happy

===== 7) Modifying CosmoLapse
Should you wish to modify the code, please change the CosmoLapse.m file.
Update Makefile to include path to your Kranc installation.
 >> make CosmoLapse
Don't forget to recompile Einstein Toolkit
 >> ./simfactory/bin/sim build -j2 --thornlist=thornlists/einsteintoolkit.th